1\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\n\ud83d\udd0d RAG Search: Miss (No matching SOP found in local Vector DB).\n\ud83d\udcdd Action: Synthesized a new SOP and requested Human-in-the-Loop review.\n\ud83c\udfab Ticket: [INC8127184] Create an IBM DB2 user venu on the host Workernode1HL and provide cloudBeaver UI Access  which is hosted on a linux Container\nProposed SOP Title: SOP: Create DB2 User and Configure CloudBeaver Access on WorkerNode1HL\nProposed Commands: ssh root@192.168.100.102 \"id -u venu &>/dev/null || useradd -m -s /bin/bash -c ''DB2 User Venu'' venu\", ssh root@192.168.100.102 \"echo ''venu:$(openssl rand -base64 12)'' | chpasswd\", ssh root@192.168.100.102 \"mkdir -p /home/venu/.ssh && chmod 700 /home/venu/.ssh && chown -R venu:venu /home/venu/.ssh\", ssh root@192.168.100.102 \"su - db2inst1 -c \"db2 connect to SAMPLE\" 2>/dev/null || su - db2inst1 -c \"db2start\"\", ssh root@192.168.100.102 \"su - db2inst1 -c \"db2 \\\"GRANT CONNECT ON DATABASE TO USER venu\\\"\"\", ssh root@192.168.100.102 \"su - db2inst1 -c \"db2 \\\"GRANT DATAACCESS ON DATABASE TO USER venu\\\"\"\", ssh root@192.168.100.102 \"su - db2inst1 -c \"db2 \\\"GRANT CREATETAB ON DATABASE TO USER venu\\\"\"\", ssh root@192.168.100.102 \"su - db2inst1 -c \"db2 connect reset\"\", ssh root@192.168.100.102 \"podman ps --filter name=cloudbeaver --format ''{{.ID}} {{.Names}} {{.Status}}'' || docker ps --filter name=cloudbeaver --format ''{{.ID}} {{.Names}} {{.Status}}''\", ssh root@192.168.100.102 \"CLOUDBEAVER_CID=$(podman ps --filter name=cloudbeaver -q 2>/dev/null || docker ps --filter name=cloudbeaver -q 2>/dev/null) && [ -n \"$CLOUDBEAVER_CID\" ] && echo \"CloudBeaver container running: $CLOUDBEAVER_CID\" || echo \"CloudBeaver container not found\"\", ssh root@192.168.100.102 \"ss -ltnp | grep -E '':8978|:8080|:3000'' | head -5\", ssh root@192.168.100.102 \"su - venu -c \"db2 connect to SAMPLE user venu using ''$DB2_VENU_PASSWORD''\" 2>&1 | head -3\", ssh root@192.168.100.102 \"id venu && ls -ld /home/venu\"\nState: Incident placed ON_HOLD awaiting human operator approval in Control Tower.\n\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501", "timestamp": "12:03:37 am"}, {"id": "act_1786082574610", "author": "\ud83e\udd16 Agentic AI Router", "comment": "\ud83e\udd16 Agentic AI Router (NVIDIA Nemotron 3 550B LLM): Auto-assigned ticket to \"DBA Team\" (Rajesh Kumar) with 95% confidence.\nReasoning: The incident requires creating an IBM DB2 user and configuring CloudBeaver UI access for database connectivity. These are core database administration tasks involving user provisioning, privilege management, and database tool access configuration, which fall squarely under DBA Team responsibilities.", "timestamp": "12:02:54 am", "isWorkNote": true}, {"id": "act_INC8127184_1", "author": "System Admin", "comment": "Logged new incident ticket INC8127184.", "timestamp": "12:02:38 am", "isWorkNote": true}]') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
