 AI Router", "comment": "\ud83e\udd16 Agentic AI Router (NVIDIA Nemotron 3 550B LLM): Auto-assigned ticket to \"DevOps Ops\" (Alex Rivera) with 90% confidence.\nReasoning: The request to create a Python virtual environment with pandas and openpyxl on a Control Plane node is an infrastructure provisioning and environment configuration task. This aligns with DevOps responsibilities for managing runtime environments, dependency management, and control plane maintenance.", "timestamp": "1:05:10 am", "isWorkNote": true}, {"id": "act_INC0001036_1", "author": "System Admin", "comment": "Logged new incident ticket INC0001036.", "timestamp": "1:04:44 am", "isWorkNote": true}]') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
